    <description>BRD ALF-RS-03 AC#2: when a Test Drive is handed over to a Sales Representative (Assigned Sales Consultant populated on create, or reassigned), the assigned rep gets a Task on the record plus a custom notification. Fires on create or on a change of AF_AssignedConsultant__c, not on every unrelated save. Reuses the AF_NT_Alfardan_Alert notification type / customNotificationAction pattern already proven in AF_FL_Lead_NotifyOnAssignment.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>NotifBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;You&apos;ve been assigned a test drive: &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>NotifTitle</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Test Drive Assigned&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>TaskActivityDate</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!$Record.AF_TestDriveDateTime__c}), TODAY() + 1, DATEVALUE({!$Record.AF_TestDriveDateTime__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>AF Test Drive Notify On Assignment {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
